(3891,'Circa Waves','Get Away','wSmNriIGnbA',NULL,'Oh, my heart is torn up<br /><br />And I need these stars<br /><br />To show how<br /><br />I left myself a long time ago<br /><br />The blinding light<br /><br />Won\'t catch me<br /><br />feed me lies<br /><br />Till I can\'t see<br /><br />That I left myself a long time ago Oh<br /><br />I couldn\'t get away if I wanted to<br /><br />My hands are tied<br /><br />Tied to you<br /><br />and I don\'t mind, no<br /><br />and I couldn\'t get away if I wanted to<br /><br />My hands are tied<br /><br />Tied to you<br /><br />and I don\'t mind, no, no<br /><br />A silver line<br /><br />round a dark sky<br /><br />And I pay no mind<br /><br />But still try<br /><br />But I left myself a long time ago<br /><br />Working day<br /><br />Will crawl through<br /><br />The time we pray<br /><br />and I forgive you<br /><br />But I left myself a long time ago<br /><br />I couldn\'t get away if I wanted to<br /><br />My hands are tied<br /><br />Tied to you<br /><br />and I don\'t mind, no<br /><br />and I couldn\'t get away if I wanted to<br /><br />My hands are tied<br /><br />Tied to you<br /><br />and I don\'t mind, no, no<br /><br />Say its easier<br /><br />When you know<br /><br />So i\'m holding out<br /><br />to gracefully grow old<br /><br />and the wiser<br /><br />Any man could be<br /><br />Makes the suffered things<br /><br />All the more easy<br /><br />The more easy<br /><br />ohhhhh<br /><br />I couldn\'t get away if I wanted to<br /><br />My hands are tied<br /><br />Tied to you<br /><br />I couldn\'t get away if I wanted to<br /><br />My hands are tied<br /><br />Tied to you<br /><br />Tied to you<br /><br />Tied to you','spotify:track:1YSXs9eJu80aJ8eE2YnmrF','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/207359275','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1659649050?i=1659649063&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/269041819',NULL,NULL,'\0'),
(3892,'Tom Williams and The Boat','All Day','4RbuEdHHXHw',NULL,'Breezing through the rubble on the 4th of May,<br />I\'ve been pulling my head down so they can\'t see my face.<br />Ah, third gear, fourth gear, fifth gear, scream.<br />I\'ma get this now, see my dreams.<br /><br />And I been dreaming of you, babe, all day.<br />And I been thinking of you, babe, all day.<br />And I\'ve been losing my mind to the thought of you and me all day.<br />And I been looking forward to you all day.<br /><br />I\'ve been dragging my heels through steel and bone,<br />and I\'ve been trying to sell my car and everything that I own.<br />And I promise I\'ll do my best, promise I\'ll be there soon,<br />dance you through the streets beneath the summer moon.<br /><br />And I been dreaming of you, babe, all day.<br />And I been thinking of you, babe, all day.<br />And I\'ve been losing my mind to the thought of you and me all day.<br />And I been looking forward to you all day.<br /><br />And there\'s a house beside the river I\'ve been driving past.<br />There\'s a school right by it, and by the telephone mast<br />there\'s the phone box that I call you from with the change I find<br />on the backseat of my taxi when the day is gone.<br /><br />And I been dreaming of you, babe, all day.<br />And I been thinking of you, babe, all day.<br />And I\'ve been losing my mind to the thought of you and me all day.<br />And I been looking forward to you all day.','spotify:track:6FVyZONgOhYiutFN66FFnR','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/74782358','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/813632079?i=813632128&at=11lJZP',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3893,'Wild Smiles','Fool For You','9KjE_gy9yMI',NULL,'Lettin\' go of memories,<br /> Takin\' pictures down.<br /> Time to get a grip on things,<br /> turn my life around.<br /> \'Cause I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> And everything you do.<br /> Here I go forgiving you.<br /> Love\'s an evil game.<br /> Lay down with a broken heart,<br /> Do you feel the same?<br /> \'Cause I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> And everything you do.<br /> Guys, you keep me hangin\' on.<br /> You keep me hangin\' on.<br /> Ahh, you keep me hangin\' on.<br /> You\'re stoppin\' me from movin\' on.<br /> Woo!<br /> Lettin\' go of memories, takin\' picures down.<br /> Time to get a grip on things,<br /> turn my life around.<br /> \'Cause I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> And everything you do.<br /> \'Cause I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> And everything you do.<br /> \'Cause I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> I\'m a fool for you,<br /> And everything I, do.','spotify:track:1sKKqbJM2Z2meCJ1MPliOp','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/639952572','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1454848321?i=1454848325&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/57512681','https://soundcloud.com/wildsmiles/foolforyou?utm_medium=api\\u0026utm_campaign=social_sharing\\u0026utm_source=id_314547',NULL,'\0'),
