(3921,'De Lux','Better at Making Time','4JgDlxPGzaw',NULL,'We\'re better at making time pass<br />From one to the other<br />There\'s nothing that we\'ll ever find hard<br />Until we get in each other\'s ways<br />We\'re better at making love when<br />When it\'s one to the other<br />There\'s nothing that we disagree on<br />It\'s just something we don\'t talk about<br />So take your things and burn our times<br />I don\'t want you to forget why<br />So take your pennies<br />Take your change<br />I don\'t want you to forget why<br />We\'re better at making time pass<br />From one to the other<br />There\'s nothing that we\'ll ever find hard<br />Until we get in each other\'s ways<br />I wanna say<br />We\'re doing great<br />But there\'s something wrong<br />Something wrong<br />Oh when you\'re in love<br />You better make sure<br />You\'re spending time<br />On making time<br />There\'s something great<br />In the way<br />You make it seem like we\'re doing great<br />We\'re better at making<br />Time<br />Pass<br />We\'re better at making time pass<br />From one to the other<br />There\'s nothing that we\'ll ever find hard<br />Until we get in each other\'s ways','spotify:track:5ORXpTkyGAD3zGe8H4MQ89','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/164210302','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1608134836?i=1608135009&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/214947972','https://soundcloud.com/createcontrolmusic/better-at-making-time?utm_medium=api\\u0026utm_campaign=social_sharing\\u0026utm_source=id_314547',NULL,'\0'),
(3922,'De Lux','It All Works All The Time','ATcxZYqE50E',NULL,'I tried to love you,<br /><br />I just stood up behind<br /><br />something stupid,<br /><br />something i\'ll never find<br /><br />if you want me to hate you,<br /><br />I would hate you<br /><br />if you want me to love you,<br /><br />I wouldn\'t know what to do.<br /><br />and it all works all the time<br /><br />and it all works all the time<br /><br />I tried to hurt you,<br /><br />I just didn\'t have the chance<br /><br />something twisted,<br /><br />but you know how it\'d fail<br /><br />but if you want me to kill you,<br /><br />I would kill you<br /><br />if you want me to love you,<br /><br />I wouldn\'t know what to do.<br /><br />If you could think of something better to say,<br /><br />you better let me know<br /><br />If you can think of something better to say,<br /><br />you better let me know<br /><br />I wouldn\'t know what to do<br /><br />and it all works all the time<br /><br />and it all works all the time<br /><br />I tried to fuck you,<br /><br />you\'d never love me that way<br /><br />its something special,<br /><br />that\'s something i\'d never say<br /><br />if you want me to bury you,<br /><br />I would bury you<br /><br />but if you want me to love you oh,<br /><br />now i know what to do<br /><br />always and always you tell me you love me but you never think about how it could raise?<br /><br />if you want me love,<br /><br />give it back, give it back,<br /><br />if you want me to love,<br /><br />give it back to me.<br /><br />If you could think of somethingbetter to say,<br /><br />you better let me know<br /><br />If you could think of somethingbetter to say,<br /><br />you better let me know<br /><br />and I\'m stuck with a life where nothing ever happens nothing at all<br /><br />forget me now<br /><br />certain situations where nothing ever changes nothing at all<br /><br />forget me now<br /><br />you\'re stuck without my face why do you love me love me at all<br /><br />forget me now<br /><br />forget me now<br /><br />forget me now<br /><br />If you could think of something of something better to say,<br /><br />you better let me know<br /><br />If you could think of something better to say,<br /><br />you better let me know<br /><br />If you could think of something better to say,<br /><br />you better let me know','spotify:track:3AkSn9K7favrzGmOHkbarS','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/164210310','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1608134836?i=1608135263&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/214947980','https://soundcloud.com/de-lux-band/it-all-works-all-the-time?utm_medium=api\\u0026utm_campaign=social_sharing\\u0026utm_source=id_314547',NULL,'\0'),
(3923,'De Lux','Moments','BdvI7iDssJk',NULL,'Taking all my moments, the ones that I got for free<br /> Nothing kills my moments<br /> Well, except for me<br /> I\'m burning all my pictures<br /> I got no need for these<br /> I got my moments, the ones that put me at ease<br /> <br /> Tell me not to worry<br /> We all know these days are bad<br /> Don\'t tell me I should hurry<br /> I got no rush, I got no stopwatch<br /> And I got no urge to fill my head with nonsense<br /> Nothing feels more perfect than feeling all my moments<br /> I got so many of these<br /> Show us, love us, they\'re all for loving<br /> They\'re all for me, they feel so<br /> <br /> I\'m feeling all my moments pass me by<br /> All my emotions running on high<br /> I start to wonder how I got here<br /> Then I remember I never remember<br /> <br /> It\'s something else (x2)<br /> <br /> I\'m running out of problems<br /> Oh, you think that\'s better<br /> It\'s not for me, it\'s not for anyone<br /> The less you\'ve got, the more you\'ll understand why<br /> Nothing feels more perfect<br /> Than living out my moments<br /> Sometimes they\'re bad, sometimes they\'re worse than bad<br /> But sometimes you get the ones that end up feeling worth it<br /> You get those ones that make you feel imperfect<br /> You get those ones that make you feel human<br /> You get those ones, you get those ones<br /> You get those ones that never rest<br /> <br /> It\'s something else (x2)','spotify:track:6IOtNd4BUtspMcUNePXmJ9','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/164210303','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1002762960?i=1002763613&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/47788730','https://soundcloud.com/innovativeleisure/moments-2?utm_medium=api\\u0026utm_campaign=social_sharing\\u0026utm_source=id_314547',NULL,'\0'),
