(3929,'Nick Waterhouse','Some Place','4nlGgqYGYtU',NULL,'There\'s some place that I\'d rather be<br /><br />It\'s something been on my mind almost constantly<br /><br />Some place I don\'t expect you to understand<br /><br />People talk to me and I know they don\'t comprehend<br /><br /><br /><br />There\'s someplace, I swear it\'s not in my mind<br /><br />But it\'s somewhere I been trying so hard to find<br /><br />Some place, I know it\'s not quite clear<br /><br />A place I can only say that it\'s not right here','spotify:track:6Rnb39QSANYHeAZX7qCw18','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/164209029','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1608133857?i=1608134381&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/214947704','https://soundcloud.com/nick-waterhouse/some-place?utm_medium=api\\u0026utm_campaign=social_sharing\\u0026utm_source=id_314547',NULL,'\0'),
(3930,'Nosaj Thing','Eclipse Blue','_woNBiIyOKI',NULL,'True blue<br /><br />The silent cry<br /><br />And I can see it<br /><br />And I want to touch it<br /><br />Please, \'cause no one sees<br /><br />True blue.<br /><br />As rain can awaste<br /><br /><br /><br />I used to know all the gates of love!<br /><br />And all the love was streaming through you<br /><br />I used to know how to please you...<br /><br />And all the love was streaming through you','spotify:track:1OO6bLZ79F3tOGkHPD0t2i','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/80148172','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1608121369?i=1608121381&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/62973665','https://soundcloud.com/innovativeleisure/nosaj-thing-eclipse-blue-feat?utm_medium=api\\u0026utm_campaign=social_sharing\\u0026utm_source=id_314547',NULL,'\0'),
(3931,'Superhumanoids','Geri','n8RjrP5Q33M',NULL,'Always, so clear.<br /><br />That you could not stay, here.<br /><br />You could not see what we saw,<br /><br />at night.<br /><br /><br /><br />Time wont, wait for<br /><br />either of us.<br /><br />We dont belong.<br /><br />Never, better.<br /><br />We both know,<br /><br />it\'s good that you\'re gone<br /><br /><br /><br />A harsh confession,<br /><br />divergent obsession.<br /><br />It came as no surprise,<br /><br />our ears, your eyes<br /><br />A short reality,<br /><br />displayed for all to see.<br /><br />Enough for far too long.<br /><br />We both know,<br /><br />it\'s good that you\'re gone<br /><br /><br /><br />Time wont, wait for<br /><br />either of us.<br /><br />We dont belong.<br /><br />Never, better.<br /><br />We both know,<br /><br />it\'s good that you\'re gone<br /><br /><br /><br />Time wont, wait for<br /><br />either of us.<br /><br />We dont belong.<br /><br />Never, better.<br /><br />We both know,<br /><br />it\'s good that you\'re gone','spotify:track:3dUnXmgA1voqM1RFFrcPoR','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/164209681','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1608120194?i=1608120201&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/214948046','https://soundcloud.com/superhumanoids/geri?utm_medium=api\\u0026utm_campaign=social_sharing\\u0026utm_source=id_314547',NULL,'\0'),
(3932,'Superhumanoids','So Strange','RjXIxYs_cJ0',NULL,'I always drive<br /><br />Always i drive so,<br /><br />To see you<br /><br />Make me hate this whole town<br /><br /><br /><br />Where it isn\'t it is<br /><br />Where it isn\'t it is<br /><br /><br /><br />Your whole town is<br /><br />So strange<br /><br />Never, never going to change<br /><br />Your connected to,<br /><br />Another mans connected to you<br /><br /><br /><br />Where it isn\'t it is<br /><br />Where it isn\'t it is<br /><br /><br /><br />Please come back to me<br /><br />So alone out here<br /><br />I couldn\'t wait for you<br /><br />My life for you could come one day<br /><br /><br /><br />Where it isn\'t it is<br /><br />Where it isn\'t it is<br /><br />Where it isn\'t it is<br /><br />Where it isn\'t it is','spotify:track:4ZqjUGXGFvq2rv3c5qPAWZ','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/164209683','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1608120194?i=1608120212&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/214948048','https://soundcloud.com/superhumanoids/so-strange?utm_medium=api\\u0026utm_campaign=social_sharing\\u0026utm_source=id_314547',NULL,'\0'),
