(3934,'Andreya Triana','Better Days to Come','c3Nabx6gAzI',NULL,'another bill through the post<br /><br /><br /><br />i would call my bank for a loan<br /><br /><br /><br />i beg, steal and then i borrow<br /><br /><br /><br />but i\'ll laugh one day<br /><br /><br /><br />be laughing with you<br /><br /><br /><br />trade up my first guitar<br /><br /><br /><br />sweet dreams sleeping in my car<br /><br /><br /><br />in the gutter looking at the stars<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />i can wait <br /><br /><br /><br />just a little bit longer<br /><br /><br /><br />got the weight of the world on me now<br /><br /><br /><br />sign of the times no doubt<br /><br /><br /><br />at night i wonder how<br /><br /><br /><br />i\'ll make ends meet<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />chorus:<br /><br /><br /><br />when the going gets tough <br /><br /><br /><br />i\'ll just hold my head up<br /><br /><br /><br />and think of better days to come<br /><br /><br /><br />better days to come<br /><br /><br /><br />when it feels too much<br /><br /><br /><br />i just throw my hands up<br /><br /><br /><br />i know theres better days to come<br /><br /><br /><br />better days to come<br /><br /><br /><br />bare cupboard, empty shelfs<br /><br /><br /><br />i can\'t even feed myself<br /><br /><br /><br />this thing aint good for my health<br /><br /><br /><br />feeling weak got to be stronger<br /><br /><br /><br />got the weight of the world on me now<br /><br /><br /><br />sign of the times no doubt<br /><br /><br /><br />at night i wonder how<br /><br /><br /><br />i\'ll make ends meet<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />chorus:<br /><br /><br /><br />when the going get tough <br /><br /><br /><br />i\'ll just hold my head up<br /><br /><br /><br />and think of better days to come<br /><br /><br /><br />better days to come<br /><br /><br /><br />when it feels too much<br /><br /><br /><br />i just throw my hands up<br /><br /><br /><br />and know theres better days to come<br /><br /><br /><