(3944,'The Death Set','Can You Seen Straight?','JSYkQAz18Bg',NULL,'How can you seen straight?*<br /><br />Is the message late?<br /><br />Seen a different face since the Fall of 08<br /><br />Every single day we made the best mistakes<br /><br />Every single day we just felt it straight<br /><br />Yeah and we seen straight?<br /><br />Not sorry we did, maybe sorry for the carnage and the wreckage<br /><br />But as a memoir, from this vantage<br /><br />We should have expected an implosion<br /><br /><br /><br />But… some of us just gave in,<br /><br />Some of us gave everything<br /><br />Whaaa ahhh lived so long on nothing<br /><br />Just to say where we\'ve been<br /><br /><br /><br />And all the times and things been though<br /><br />Had to be, to be renewed<br /><br /><br /><br />How could we seen straight, no time to think<br /><br />Wrong people hit for the right thing<br /><br />Every day pear but still went in and isn\'t that the idea of the mission<br /><br />How could we seen straight, shake it off<br /><br />And who cares who is pissed but the four of us!<br /><br />But, this story\'s sung and now it\'s perfect time to move on<br /><br /><br /><br />But… some of us just gave in, some of us gave everything<br /><br />Whaaa ahhh lived so long on nothing, just to say where we\'ve been<br /><br /><br /><br />And all the times and things been though<br /><br />Had to be to be renewed<br /><br /><br /><br />But fuck it what do I know?','spotify:track:23ar9Sjrg3dksXupN6jh1C','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/11926980','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/438735447?i=438735452&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/6758338',NULL,NULL,'\0'),
