(53139,16301,8285,'NO','NO','jTIAok2WFfo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,20,'\"I would surrender for just one word from you<br /><br>A smile would fill my heart or overflow<br /><br><br /><br>But it\'s not easy<br /><br><br /><br>Tried to remember the time I first saw you<br /><br>And once I liked that day<br /><br><br /><br>But it\'s not easy<br /><br><br /><br>But it\'s all right it\'s all right it\'s all right<br /><br>it\'s all right it\'s all right it\'s all right<br /><br><br /><br>A solid guitar in my hands is what I want<br /><br>To fight the idea of becoming a part of your life<br /><br><br /><br>But it\'s not easy<br /><br><br /><br>Spend time with good friends, the best I\'ve ever had<br /><br>Rodrigo knows and sings what I can\'t get<br /><br><br /><br>But it\'s not easy<br /><br><br /><br>But it\'s all right it\'s allright it\'s alright<br /><br>it\'s alright it\'s alright it\'s alright<br /><br><br /><br>Babaraba bababa<br /><br>Babaraba bababa\"',NULL,'\0','Harsh=01.enq',NULL,''),
(53140,16312,8285,'NO','NO','VBrZ0YUpP78',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,170,'\"I like to hand out all night<br /><br>And party \'til I vom<br /><br>I don\'t like stuck-up people<br /><br>Who think they know it all<br /><br><br /><br>Oh no, let\'s go<br /><br>They\'ve thrown me out of school<br /><br>Oh no, let\'s go<br /><br>I\'ve broken all the rules<br /><br><br /><br>Please tell me why I\'m lonely<br /><br>And I\'ve no friends at all<br /><br>I know I\'m not no genius<br /><br>But just don\'t call me stupid<br /><br><br /><br>My dad says it\'s the army<br /><br>If I\'m not up by Fall<br /><br>My girl says I\'m a loser<br /><br>And I\'m no use at all<br /><br><br /><br>Oh no, let\'s go<br /><br>Don\'t wanna hear no more<br /><br>Oh no, let\'s go<br /><br>She\'s walkin\' out the door<br /><br><br /><br>Please tell me why I\'m lonely<br /><br>And I\'ve no friends at all<br /><br>I\'m just a teenage misfit<br /><br>No answers when I call<br /><br><br /><br>Please tell me why I\'m lonely<br /><br>And I\'ve no friends at all<br /><br>I know I\'m not no genius<br /><br>But just don\'t call me stupid<br /><br><br /><br>Don\'t call me stupid\"',NULL,'\0','Harsh=16.enq',NULL,''),
