(53142,5113,8285,'NO','NO','HonrxbV-rNA',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,30,'May i please have your attention<br /> Everybody follow my direction<br /> Everybody get on your feet<br /> Everybody go out you street, now<br /> <br /> Everybody take your radio<br /> Tune it to your favorite rock and roll show, now<br /> Everybody sing it with me,<br /> Sing it on the count of three<br /> <br /> 1, 2, 3!<br /> <br /> Now, everyone turn up your radio,<br /> Turn it up loud so the whole world knows,<br /> That united we stand wherever we go,<br /> It\'s American Rock N\' Roll!<br /> <br /> One more time,<br /> <br /> Now everyone take your radio,<br /> Hold it up high over your head, now<br /> Turn every dial up to ten,<br /> Shake the world with the sound of Freedom<br /> <br /> Everybody take your radio<br /> Tune it to your favorite rock and roll show, now<br /> Everybody sing it with me,<br /> Sing it on the count of three<br /> <br /> 1, 2, 3!<br /> <br /> Now, everyone turn up your radio,<br /> Turn it up loud so the whole world knows,<br /> That united we stand wherever we go,<br /> It\'s American Rock N\' Roll!<br /> <br /> Everybody take your radio<br /> Tune it to your favorite rock and roll show, now<br /> Everybody sing it with me,<br /> Sing it on the count of three<br /> <br /> 1, 2, 3!<br /> <br /> Now, everyone turn up your radio,<br /> Turn it up loud so the whole world knows,<br /> That united we stand wherever we go,<br /> It\'s American Rock N\' Roll!<br /> <br /> That united we stand wherever we go,<br /> It\'s American Rock N\' Roll!<br /> <br /> It\'s American Rock N\' Roll!<br /> It\'s American Rock N\' Roll!<br /> It\'s American Rock N\' Roll!',NULL,'\0','Harsh=02.enq',NULL,'\0'),
