(53147,16304,8285,'NO','NO','QU0a81r_-Y4','spotify:track:7pxYBBAF8vG3vJd55TiIDd','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/338412584','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1816716006?i=1816716007&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/438057107',NULL,NULL,NULL,90,'\"Going down for the count<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br><br /><br>Sometimes you can feel your life breaking<br /><br>Getting rough at the edges, and you just can\'t take it<br /><br>anymore with your eyes shut black<br /><br>nailed down with a hammer and your mind\'s jacked up<br /><br>What? You can hear a language in your ear<br /><br>hissing softly like an insect digging in<br /><br>it\'s telling you to look around at what you got<br /><br>Tell yourself that the TV always got it messed up, up, up, up, up<br /><br>the TV always got it messed up, up, up, up, up<br /><br>yeah it messed me up<br /><br><br /><br>What happens when my reason breaks?<br /><br>You pulled me in<br /><br>I cast my doubt<br /><br>But now I\'m all strung out<br /><br>I follow you<br /><br>Without a sound<br /><br>But now I\'m all worked out<br /><br>Going down<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br><br /><br>Why did it take years of this captivation<br /><br>Waiting days at a time to feed my addiction<br /><br>to the waste that I\'m fed by the image on the tubes<br /><br>Everything they\'re feeding me is nothing I can use<br /><br>Reality is what I choose<br /><br>Reality is what I choose<br /><br><br /><br>What happens when my reason breaks?<br /><br>You pulled me in<br /><br>I cast my doubt<br /><br>But now I\'m all strung out<br /><br>I follow you<br /><br>Without a sound<br /><br>But now I\'m all worked out<br /><br>You pulled me in<br /><br>I cast my doubt<br /><br>But now I\'m all strung out<br /><br>Going down<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br>Going down<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br>Going down<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br>Going down<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br>Going down, down<br /><br><br /><br>Sometimes you feel your life breaking<br /><br>Getting rough at the edges and you just can\'t take it, anymore,<br /><br>With your eyes sewn shut<br /><br>Tell yourself that the TV always got it messed up, up, up, up<br /><br>the TV always got it messed up, up, up, up, up<br /><br>But now I\'m<br /><br>yeah it messed me up<br /><br><br /><br>You pulled me in<br /><br>I cast my doubt<br /><br>But now I\'m all strung out<br /><br>I follow you<br /><br>Without a sound<br /><br>But now I\'m all worked out<br /><br>You pulled me in<br /><br>I cast my doubt<br /><br>But now I\'m all strung out<br /><br>I follow you<br /><br>Without a sound<br /><br>But now I\'m all worked out<br /><br>Going<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br>Going<br /><br>Going down for the count<br /><br>Going down<br /><br>Going down for the count\"',NULL,'\0','Harsh=08.enq',NULL,'\0'),
(53148,16303,8285,'NO','NO','mON7gw2LgSk',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,70,'\"I meant to buy you flowers of Valentine\'s, it\'s true I thought you do,<br /><br>It just slipped my mind again,<br /><br>I\'ve tried not to forget about that last chance, the girl was gone, I swear,<br /><br>It slipped my mind again,<br /><br><br /><br>It\'s not that I don\'t think about you,<br /><br>I\'m not trying to pretend,<br /><br>There\'s someone who should know about my friend...<br /><br>I\'m in love with a different girl,<br /><br>Another day, another world,<br /><br>I would tell you if I could,<br /><br>And you will slip my mind for good...<br /><br><br /><br>I went down to the store, forgot to close the door, oh no, I guess:<br /><br>It just slipped my mind again.<br /><br>When I got that cone I was not alone and I,<br /><br>So I made a mess of everything.<br /><br><br /><br>It\'s not that I don\'t think about you,<br /><br>I\'m not trying to pretend,<br /><br>There\'s someone who should know about my friend...<br /><br>I\'m in love with a different girl,<br /><br>Another day, another world,<br /><br>I would tell you if I could,<br /><br>And you will slip my mind for good...<br /><br>It\'s not the end, it\'s not the end, it\'s not the end of the world!<br /><br><br /><br>Thought I\'ll take you through but I\'ll take it pretty quick if you don\'t mind,<br /><br>Slips my mind again...<br /><br><br /><br>I\'m in love with a different girl,<br /><br>Another day, another world,<br /><br>I would tell you if I could,<br /><br>And you will slip my mind for good.<br /><br><br /><br>I\'m in love with a different girl,<br /><br>Another day, another world,<br /><br>Another day, another world,<br /><br>I\'m in love with a different girl...<br /><br><br /><br>It\'s not the end...<br /><br>It\'s not the end...<br /><br>It\'s not the end...<br /><br>It\'s not the end...<br /><br>It\'s not the end!\"',NULL,'\0','Harsh=06.enq',NULL,'\0'),
