(53188,16354,8290,'NO','NO','gGLT_fARWNo','spotify:track:30eLxmzvIYLnw88xgPmTJ6','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/146153854','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1580540295?i=1580540838&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/193740261',NULL,NULL,NULL,140,'\"You make me feel like I\'m young again<br />\nYeah I remember way back when<br />\nMy first case of puppy love<br />\nThat sweet young thing that I was dreamin\' of<br />\nNow here you are \'bout half my age<br />\nYou got me climbin\' right outta my cage<br />\nThis heart of mine\'s in a helluva fix<br />\nBut you can teach this old dog some new tricks<br />\n<br />\nI already know how to sit up and beg<br />\nI can roll over and shake my leg<br />\nI can speak \'cept when I look at you<br />\nAnd I\'d sure lie down if you tell me to<br />\nI been house broke and heart broke too<br />\nBut stayin\' was always hard for me to do<br />\nI don\'t have any fleas or ticks<br />\nSo come on teach this old dog some new tricks<br />\n<br />\nDon\'t wanna hear bad dog go home<br />\n\'Cause I\'ve spent plenty of time all alone<br />\nAn\' don\'t you start by pullin\' my chain<br />\n\'Cause I ain\'t lookin\' for no more pain<br />\nMan\'s best friend, well I\'m tellin\' you<br />\nI can be a woman\'s best friend too<br />\nGimme a kiss and you\'ll get your licks<br />\nCome on teach this old dog some new tricks<br />\n<br />\nCome on teach this old dog some new tricks\"',NULL,'\0','SHR=13.enq',NULL,'\0'),
