(54381,12752,8405,'NO','NO','7NlJMeillMw','spotify:track:01IMh5WFQaue00hdCAu9Po','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/378276641','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/1485042117?i=1485042122&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/121119339',NULL,NULL,NULL,70,'I don\'t want to hear another word. You\'re over it it seems.<br /> I don\'t think you\'ll mind the end too much if it justifies your means.<br /> All this silence once disturbed me now there\'s nothing more to say.<br /> Unless you speak what\'s on your mind you can go your separate way.<br /> <br /> Wake me up when it\'s all over, I\'ve got things to do.<br /> I\'d like to get on with my life if it\'s with or without you.<br /> And it breaks my heart to see all that we\'ve done just thrown away.<br /> And I don\'t wanna live like this today.<br /> <br /> For the last four years I\'ve come to but my head against this wall.<br /> For all my troubles I\'ve found I\'ve got nowhere at all.<br /> I try to speak but no one hears a single word I say.<br /> My desperation seems to grow with every show I play<br /> <br /> I may be down, but I\'m not out, there\'s a few rounds left to go.<br /> I\'ve been around this circle enough times I ought to know.<br /> Life is what you make of it and I\'m too tired to play.<br /> And I don\'t want to live like this today.<br /> <br /> I\'m so tired of feeling like I do<br /> From waiting to see if we will change<br /> All that we thought we\'d never be is what we live today.<br /> And I don\'t want to live my life this way.<br /> <br /> [?]<br /> <br /> I don\'t want to watch this history repeat itself again.<br /> I get ashamed of what we\'ve all become, we started out as friends.<br /> Don\'t bother talking to me when you find out who you are.<br /> I\'ll never walk the same as you. I don\'t care anymore.<br /> <br /> Wake me up when it\'s all over, I\'ve got things to do.<br /> I\'d like to get on with my life if it\'s with or without you.<br /> And it breaks my heart to see all that we\'ve done just thrown away.<br /> And I don\'t wanna live like this today.',NULL,'\0',NULL,NULL,'\0'),
(54382,12754,8405,'NO','NO','b4Y1oSFY6FA','spotify:track:2HY0xuuAqkGAlocHJ2Plu3','deezer://www.deezer.com/track/3920798','https://geo.music.apple.com/pl/album/_/269180904?i=269180914&at=11lJZP','https://listen.tidal.com/track/10915846','https://soundcloud.com/thelivingendofficial/the-living-end-prisoner-of',NULL,NULL,50,'(one, two) (one, two)<br /> Well we don\'t need no one to tell us what to do<br /> Oh yes we\'re on our own<br /> And theres nothing you can do<br /> So we don\'t need no one like you<br /> To tell us what to do<br /> <br /> We don\'t refer to the past<br /> When showing what we\'ve done<br /> Our generation gap<br /> Means the war is never won<br /> The past is in your head<br /> THE FUTURE\'S IN OUR HANDS!<br /> <br /> Cos I\'m a brat<br /> And I know everything<br /> And I talk back<br /> Cos I\'m not listening<br /> To anything you say<br /> <br /> And if you count to 3 (one, two, three)<br /> You\'ll see it\'s no emergency<br /> You\'ll see I\'m not the enemy<br /> Just a Prisoner of Society<br /> <br /> Well we don\'t need no one to tell us what to do<br /> Oh yes we\'re on our own<br /> And theres nothing you can do<br /> So we don\'t need no one like you<br /> To tell us what to do<br /> <br /> Cos I\'m a brat<br /> And I know everything<br /> And I talk back<br /> Cos I\'m not listening<br /> To anything you say<br /> <br /> And if you count to 3 (one, two, three)<br /> You\'ll see it\'s no emergency<br /> You\'ll see I\'m not the enemy<br /> Just a Prisoner of Society<br /> <br /> (GO!)<br /> <br /> Well we don\'t need no one to tell us what to do<br /> Oh yes we\'re on our own<br /> And theres nothing you can do<br /> So we don\'t need no one like you<br /> To tell us what to do<br /> <br /> We don\'t refer to the past<br /> When showing what we\'ve done<br /> Our generation gap<br /> Means the war is never won<br /> So we don\'t need no one like you<br /> To tell us what to do<br /> <br /> Cos I\'m a brat<br /> And I know everything<br /