omething I\'ve endured See I don\'t think I can fight this anymore (fight this anymore) I\'m listening with one foot out the door But something has to die to be reborn I don\'t want to be here anymore<br />(We need a better way) (We need to let go) [x2]<br />Anymore (We need a better way) (We need to let go) (We need a better way)','Removed in update 1.8.0?','\0',NULL,NULL,'\0'),
